<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Overall progress: <VAR NAME="全体進行率" unk3="50">%...
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花悲しい.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Having come this far, this is still all that we have learned.
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
It seems this world has expanded far more than I imagined.<PG>
As long as <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama seeks to know the truth, I will go on supporting <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, just as before.<PG>
However, the newly appeared scenarios are all of an extraordinary length.<PG>
Their dates and times are unknown, too. Could that be the effect of the long-hidden truth bursting forth all at once?<PG>
I will record these long scenarios as checkpoints at suitable places, so I hope you will proceed at ease, without tensing up.<PG>
Once you have passed a checkpoint, you may close this world as before and still start again from where you left off.<PG>
Now, this world exists for <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama.<PG>
From here, please confirm the truth with your own eyes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日お辞儀.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
